  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria Humanitarian Response Programme: Supporting NGO Safety in Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A 72-month project (April 2023 &#x2013; March 2029) with a FCDO budget of &#xa3;4,450,000, achieved by providing humanitarian organisations with timely, reliable, and high-quality safety services that help them plan, operate, and deliver aid more safely. To achieve this, INSO will i) provide NGOs with real-time alerts, incident reporting, and in-depth conflict and access analysis; ii) facilitate coordination through safety roundtables, country director meetings, and advisory support; and iii) strengthen NGOs&apos; own preparedness and crisis management capacity through specialised security training.</narrative>
  </description>
